<title>USA: ITT to sell Desert Inn and Tunica casino.</title>
<headline>ITT to sell Desert Inn and Tunica casino.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>ITT Corp said it decided to put the Desert Inn in Las Vegas and its riverboat casino in Tunica, Mississippi, up for sale.</p>
<p>The company said the two properties added $2 million, or $0.02 a share, on an after-tax basis to its second-quarter earnings. It reflected the two as &quot;assets held for sale&quot; in its second-quarter earnings.</p>
